        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"ef60a9e6-21e1-48c4-8896-f88d9730b5f1\",\"review_text\":\"Good but if it has downloading option it will be wonderful.\"},{\"review_id\":\"c13494dc-510e-4d79-a597-8f38c1bb8c62\",\"review_text\":\"The recent update was a terrible mistake.. uninstalled the app right away .\"},{\"review_id\":\"92067fd6-6112-4789-bd2a-aacb7b9d4817\",\"review_text\":\"Seeeeeen saaanam 😈😈😈🔥🔥🥵🥵🥵🥵\"},{\"review_id\":\"bdc3bf9a-f3d0-451e-8036-c0b95e28edce\",\"review_text\":\"STOP UPDATING IT OMG IT GETS WORSE. Im convinced that they're trying to make it worse for their users everytime. The amount of songs you can pick is limited??? What the hell are you doing spotify?\"},{\"review_id\":\"de1f0a51-2fe1-4842-ad83-bb845a71a1bb\",\"review_text\":\"Q at I E a great time at I'm listening to the music of my life and you're very good at making the time of my life _thanks\"},{\"review_id\":\"3320ae4b-8fbf-4703-83e1-2767da2781da\",\"review_text\":\"The premium features have stealed everything......we can't even choose specific parts to listen....pls at least let the non premium users choose and listen to the specific parts off the song.\"},{\"review_id\":\"d3bc589a-333d-4ab3-a07b-f7d483debc61\",\"review_text\":\"Love. Well organized. 👏🏼\"},{\"review_id\":\"89b47b43-0e83-49d1-b6db-583d8cf82966\",\"review_text\":\"Had all the songs that I wanted\"},{\"review_id\":\"9fb86baa-0e5f-41a1-839e-d0126a11c40b\",\"review_text\":\"W app\"},{\"review_id\":\"35955d9a-1590-4124-8c36-238a6c68b801\",\"review_text\":\"It's nice 👍🙂🙂\"}]}"
